{"ID":"20240206094712-wonb9iq","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240206094712-wonb9iq","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206094712-wonb9iq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206094721-byq273z\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614101451-f5a9656\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1000,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240704100232-a4j7gci\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:4,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:4\u0026#125;","title":"362补05赤小豆","type":"doc","updated":"20240904193036"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240828125218-jibyz5d","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20240828125218-jibyz5d","updated":"20240904193036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"版本一"}]},{"ID":"20240828125237-j1j4koq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"heading-fold":"1","id":"20240828125237-j1j4koq","updated":"20240904193036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"赤小豆"}]},{"ID":"20240206094721-byq273z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"heading-fold":"1","id":"20240206094721-byq273z","updated":"20240904193036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于湖南、江西、广东、浙江等地。\n【性状】\t干燥种子略呈圆柱形而稍扁，长5"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7mm，直径约3mm，种皮赤褐色或紫褐色，平滑，微有光泽，种脐线形，白色，约为全长的2/3，中间凹陷成一纵沟，偏向一端，背面有一条不明显的棱脊。质坚硬，不易破碎，除去种皮，可见两瓣乳白色于仁。气微，嚼之有豆腥味。\n【性味】\t甘、酸，平。\n【功效】\t利水除湿，和血排脓，消肿解毒。治水肿，脚气，黄疸，泻痢，便血，痈肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240206094715-bf7besj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"heading-fold":"1","id":"20240206094715-bf7besj","updated":"20240904193036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 616px;","style":"width: 606px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"