},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828131914-s0n6cb7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828131914-s0n6cb7","updated":"20240828133224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 595px;","style":"width: 585px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"赤小豆对比 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/赤小豆对比 2-20240828131914-is7fqe0.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 585px;\" parent-style=\"width: 595px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240828131616-s2uojkd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828131616-s2uojkd","updated":"20240828131540"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（上三图，左为小豆，右为饭豆）"}]},{"ID":"20240828125251-memi8va","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828125251-memi8va","updated":"20240828131540"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：据百草恒益考证，真正的赤小豆其实是粮食中的红小豆；（现代所使用的赤小豆，大概是从清朝过后那段时间进口而来）"}]},{"ID":"20240828130547-ybh0ars","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828130547-ybh0ars","updated":"20240828131540"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"二注：红小豆不是红豆，红豆煮熟后吃起来口感是软棉的，红小豆煮后质地偏硬，不易咀嚼；"}]},{"ID":"20240828125502-ew4plaz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828125502-ew4plaz","updated":"20240828132636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"这里将赤小豆分为两个版本（展开查看），版本一为人们熟知现代的赤小豆，版本二为红小豆，具体请以实际临床疗效为准；"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240828133140-g4l7e9n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240828133140-g4l7e9n","updated":"20240828134047"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"四注：品种过多，植株图片图源较少且混乱不堪，关于红小豆取图也没什么信心（大多数人把红豆、红小豆混为一谈），如有错误犯请指正；"}]},{"ID":"20240614101447-2tnooay","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614101447-2tnooay","updated":"20240828131540"}},{"ID":"20240614102239-mt94krv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614102239-mt94krv","updated":"20240614102244"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240614102239-d2lygzm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102239-d2lygzm","updated":"20240614102239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"神农黄帝咸，雷公甘，九月采（《御览》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102239-zjr3x6c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102239-zjr3x6c","updated":"20240614102239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生大山，九月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102239-5hywq4x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102239-5hywq4x","updated":"20240614102239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：椒豆也，象豆生之形也。荅，小椒也，藿椒之少也。《广雅》云：大豆，椒也，小豆，荅也，豆角谓之荚，其叶谓之藿。《尔雅》云，戎叔，谓之荏叔，孙炎云大豆也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102258-sgulh47","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614102258-sgulh47"}},{"ID":"20240614102259-8bnbzsb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614102259-8bnbzsb","updated":"20240614102309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240614102259-0a2rm3p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102259-0a2rm3p","updated":"20240614102259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（菽豆）利小肠湿热"}]},{"ID":"20240614102259-6t8nj1h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102259-6t8nj1h","updated":"20240614102259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆（专入小肠。）甘酸色赤。心之谷也。其性下行入阴。通小肠而利有形之病。故与桑白皮同为利水除湿之剂。（十剂曰。燥可去湿。桑白皮赤小豆之属是也。）是以水气内停。而见溺闭腹肿。手足挛痹。痈肿疮疽。非此莫治。（朱氏集验方云。宋仁宗在东宫时患 腮。命道士赞宁治之。取小豆七七粒为末。敷之而愈。中贵人任承亮后患恶疮近死。尚书郎傅永授以药。立愈。叩其方。赤小豆也。予苦胁疽。既至五脏。医以药治之。甚验。承亮曰。得非赤小豆耶。医谢曰。某用此活三十口。愿勿复言。有僧发背如烂瓜。邻家乳婢用此治之如神。但其性最粘。敷毒。干则难揭。入苎根末。即不粘。此法尤佳。）且能止湿解酒。通胎下乳。（陈自明。予妇食素。产后七日乳脉不行。服药无效。偶得赤小豆一升。煮粥食之。当夜遂行。）至十剂取此为燥。亦以水行而燥自生之意。并非因其药性本燥而言也。故书又戒多服。则令人津液枯槁而燥。取紧小而赤黯色者良。（若半黑半红为相思子。非赤小豆也。）"}]},{"ID":"20240614102358-1y4u7z0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614102358-1y4u7z0"}},{"ID":"20240614102359-3jo8i3f","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614102359-3jo8i3f","updated":"20240614102403"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614102359-9isshtm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102359-9isshtm","updated":"20240614102359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘、酸，平、温，无毒。主下水，排痈肿脓血。寒热，热中，消渴，止泄，利小便，吐逆，卒 ，下胀满。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102359-w4rf24h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102359-w4rf24h","updated":"20240614102359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大、小豆共条，犹如葱、薤义也。以大豆为 ，芽生便干之，名为黄卷，用之亦熬，服食家所须。煮大豆，主温毒、水肿殊效。复有白大豆，不入药。小豆性逐津液，久食令人枯燥矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102359-2bjjach","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102359-2bjjach","updated":"20240614102359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕《别录》云∶叶名藿，止小便数，去烦热。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102337-8bxub1y","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614102337-8bxub1y"}},{"ID":"20240614102339-e76lsa3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614102339-e76lsa3","updated":"20240614102343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆《本草害利》"}]},{"ID":"20240614102339-2b4ywbj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102339-2b4ywbj","updated":"20240614102339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔害〕最渗津液，久服令人枯燥，肌瘦身重。凡水肿胀满，总属脾虚，当杂补脾胃药中用之，病已即去，勿过剂也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102339-uzrj13j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102339-uzrj13j","updated":"20240614102339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔利〕甘酸平，入心小肠，性下行而通，行水散血，去虫止渴，行津液，清气分，涤烦蒸，通乳汁，胎产最要，除痢疾，止呕吐，脾胃最宜。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102339-4b69zc4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102339-4b69zc4","updated":"20240614102339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治有形之病，消胀散肿，凡疮疽溃烂几绝者，为末敷，无不立效。鸡子青调涂，性粘，干则难揭，入苎根末，则不粘。未溃者箍之，则四敛中起，已溃者敷之就瘥。相想子苦平，研服，能治心腹邪气，风痰瘴疟及蛊毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102339-s3p5uan","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102339-s3p5uan","updated":"20240614102339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔修治〕深秋八月采，以紧小而赤黯色者入药，其稍大而鲜红淡红色者，并不治病。今肆中半粒黑者，是相思子，一名红豆，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102347-dv09lg9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614102347-dv09lg9"}},{"ID":"20240614102349-wzrj790","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614102349-wzrj790","updated":"20240614102353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240614102349-3fvh9v1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102349-3fvh9v1","updated":"20240614102349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"食之行小便，久则虚人，令人黑瘦枯燥。关西、河北、京东西多食之。花治宿酒渴病。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102326-fk8mmo8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614102326-fk8mmo8"}},{"ID":"20240614102327-dlioy6j","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614102327-dlioy6j","updated":"20240614102331"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240614102327-xl1ctqh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102327-xl1ctqh","updated":"20240614102327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禀秋燥之气以生，味甘酸兼辛、气平，无毒。甘酸有敛逆之功，辛平有散湿热之力，所以为排脓消肿、胀满湿痹、止渴止泄、健脾燥湿之用。色赤为心之谷，其性下行，入阴分，通小肠，治有形之病，消痰散肿，虽溃烂几绝者，为末敷之无不立效。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102327-t1fxykj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102327-t1fxykj","updated":"20240614102327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆，性下行。而通小肠，入阴分。治久形之积，下水气，散消肿，止呕吐，陈泻痢，解热毒。和桑白皮煎，治湿痹。延手足胀大。同活鲤鱼煮，疗脾气。人脐腹突高，利小便去胀满，除消渴下胞衣，通乳汁。久服令人枯燥，肌瘦身重，以其专健脾胃，行津液，消水湿，降令太过也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102327-h9xv75n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102327-h9xv75n","updated":"20240614102327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治（痘疹合参） 善利小便，散毒排脓，消渴止泻。凡小儿未出疮疹者可常食。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102327-apfnfos","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102327-apfnfos","updated":"20240614102327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"疮疹作渴，以此煎汤饮之亦可。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102316-kqbbhkh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614102316-kqbbhkh"}},{"ID":"20240614102317-3icsahl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614102317-3icsahl","updated":"20240614102322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆《本草撮要》"}]},{"ID":"20240614102317-5h1n8ek","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102317-5h1n8ek","updated":"20240614102317"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘酸平．入手少阴太阳经．功专散血利水．得桑皮去湿肿．得通草能下气．得鸡子敷痈疡．同鲤鱼煮食消水肿．凡外疡溃烂．为末敷之立效．性极粘．入苎根末则不粘．止渴解酒．通乳汁．下胞胎．久食令人瘦．半红半黑者名相思子．一名红豆．苦平有毒．吐心腹邪气．风痰瘴疟虫蛊毒．研二十七枚服．"}]},{"ID":"20240614102249-658ibl5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614102249-658ibl5"}},{"ID":"20240614102250-cc48mss","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614102250-cc48mss","updated":"20240614102254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆《汤液本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614102250-o88ouaw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102250-o88ouaw","updated":"20240614102250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气温，味辛、甘、酸，阴中之阳。无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102250-xkc37bn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102250-xkc37bn","updated":"20240614102250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草》云∶主下水，排脓，寒热热中消渴。止泄，利小便，吐逆卒 ，下胀满。又治水肿，通健脾胃。赤小豆，食之行小便，久食则虚人，令人黑瘦枯燥。赤小豆花，治宿酒渴病，即腐婢也。花有腐气，故以名之。与葛花末，服方寸匕，饮酒不知醉。气味平辛。大豆黄卷，是以生豆为 ，待其芽出，便曝干用。方书名黄卷皮，产妇药中用之。性平。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101904-jgtcfqk","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614101904-jgtcfqk"}},{"ID":"20240614101929-9vgcsqd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614101929-9vgcsqd","updated":"20240614101933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240614102029-1uik6wy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102029-1uik6wy","updated":"20240614102106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"待老收采，以紧小而赤黯色者，入药。其稍大而鲜红及淡红色者，及三青二黄时，收之仅可供食，不疗疾。近用赤黑相间之草实为赤小豆，谬甚。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102029-sk5v2gz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102029-sk5v2gz","updated":"20240614102029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味甘酸平，心之谷也。其性下行，通乎小肠，能入阴分，治有形之病。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102029-mcyy3kv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102029-mcyy3kv","updated":"20240614102104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治下水肿，通气健脾胃。（治水而不知补胃，则失之壅滞，惟赤豆之用不然。）治热毒，散恶血，排痈肿脓血。疗寒热热中消渴，去烦止泄痢，利小便，除下腹胀满，吐逆卒澼。解酒病，缩气行风，散气去关节烦热，治产难下胞衣，通乳汁。（诸本草）"}]},{"ID":"20240614102029-23anpak","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102029-23anpak","updated":"20240614102102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"方书治脚气黄疸，痫证谵妄，下血，鹤膝风。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102029-e8wrtsj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102029-e8wrtsj","updated":"20240614102100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"和通草煮食，则下气无限。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102029-eaktu4w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102029-eaktu4w","updated":"20240614102057"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"和桑白皮煮食，去湿气痹肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102029-sd2acif","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102029-sd2acif","updated":"20240614102056"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"和鲤鱼煮食，甚治脚气。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102029-wz9p69p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102029-wz9p69p","updated":"20240614102053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"和鲤鱼、蠡鱼、鲫鱼、黄雌鸡煮食，并能利水消肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102029-kgmc0hs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102029-kgmc0hs","updated":"20240614102052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同鸡子白，涂一切毒肿。其性粘，干则难揭。入苧根末，即不粘。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102029-ruwuflv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102029-ruwuflv","updated":"20240614102050"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一切痈疽疮疥，及赤肿，不拘善恶，水调涂之，无不愈者。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102029-b8ce80f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102029-b8ce80f","updated":"20240614102029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"产后七日，乳脉不行，服药无效。赤小豆一升，煮粥食之，当夜即行。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102029-gmti189","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102029-gmti189","updated":"20240614102029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水气脚气，最为急用。有人患脚气，以袋盛此豆，朝夕践踏，展转之，久久遂愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102029-cms7zlq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102029-cms7zlq","updated":"20240614102029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"豆为肾水之主谷，赤小者又为肾之心物，水之用药。故主水用不行，致作水肿及痈脓者。（子繇）"}]},{"ID":"20240614102029-xhe2xfz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102029-xhe2xfz","updated":"20240614102047"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禀秋燥之气以生，凡水肿胀满泄痢，皆湿气伤脾所致。小豆健脾行湿，故能下水肿胀满，止泻，利小便也。（仲淳）"}]},{"ID":"20240614102029-iw0cuho","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102029-iw0cuho","updated":"20240614102029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"水肿从脚起，入腹则杀人。赤小豆一斗，煮极烂，取汁五升，温渍足膝。若已入腹，但食小豆，勿杂食，亦验。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102029-2kzdr2b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102029-2kzdr2b","updated":"20240614102029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又治水肿，以东行花发枝烧灰一升，淋汁，煮赤豆一升，代饭良。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102029-wtr5ro4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102029-wtr5ro4","updated":"20240614102045"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入赤小豆当归散，治先血后便。是行水化，即以达血滞也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102029-ajdy92l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102029-ajdy92l","updated":"20240614102043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入红豆丸，辅丁香、胡椒、砂仁，治诸呕逆及膈气反胃。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102029-9xo2n2i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102029-9xo2n2i","updated":"20240614102029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是虚寒补阳，亦借此味之化也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102029-4lfngsk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102029-4lfngsk","updated":"20240614102041"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"难产，日久气乏。赤小豆一升，水九升，煮取汁。入炙过黄明胶（或用阿胶）一两，同煎少时。一服五合，三四服即产。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102029-sm2ik6a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102029-sm2ik6a","updated":"20240614102040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胞衣不下。用赤小豆，男七枚，女二七枚。东流水吞服之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102029-k1ond56","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102029-k1ond56","updated":"20240614102037"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"按妊娠诸经，轮月养胎，独手少阴、手太阳二经不与。以此二经平居则为月水，有胎则为乳汁，故不在养胎之类也。夫胚胎之兆始，受水精而成血脉，受火精而成气。即此可识赤小豆下胎下乳汁，治产难之故矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102029-bs5xikz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102029-bs5xikz","updated":"20240617115401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔论〕赤小豆以夏至后布种，至秋花实。秋将尽而取其老赤者，方可入药。夫其本三阴进气之候以生，乘三秋凉肃之气以成。濒湖乃以为心之谷，何哉？盖离中有坎，而肾脉之上至于肺，更由肺以入心，使阳得阴以为生化，此天气下降之元。《经》所谓肺贯心脉而行呼吸者。明此则金气告成，乃正得为火之用。故必取其老赤者以入药耳，焉得不谓之心谷乎。又言其性下行，通于小肠。斯义更完，何者？阳得阴以行其化，小肠固为心主行其气化者也。心主血，血原于金水，而成于木火。血能生化，而后水化之府，乃以达火之气而致水之用，是金气告成而乃为火用者。固天气下降之本始，火得金用而即能达水者，实天气下降之化机。如阳不得阴以行其化，则火之气不达，即水之化不行，所以病于湿气而化热。若烦满消渴吐逆，或小便不利，及暴痢，甚则下腹胀满，或为水肿也。盖阳中之阴不足，即病于阳之不化以为湿，其义若此。诸书谓赤豆能除湿，亦几近之。如谓其燥湿，则大误矣。即其能治水肿，卢氏便谓为肾之心物，水之用药。盖人身气化在下焦，气原出于水中。水化在上焦，水又始于气中。如濒湖谓为心之谷，是阳得阴以化。而阳之化者，止为水之元也。始子繇谓为肾之心物，是指阳得阴以化，而阴即随阳以化者，乃为水之用也。惟阳得化于阴而水元裕，阴又即化于阳而水用行。故《本经》首主水肿，而拯难产，下胞衣，通乳汁，皆其的剂。至下焦之病，如下血脚气鹤膝风，皆得于心与小肠之气化，裕其元以达其用者，推治之矣。第如甄权所谓烦满通气，士良所谓缩气行风，孟诜所谓散气去骨节烦热，并治热毒云云者，的属气欤水欤？曰：凡人气化布而后水化行，是固然矣。然气原出水中，如肾脉之由肺而至心者不足，亦或肺不足以至之，即谓之水元不裕。水元不裕而气化不布，乃致烦热在关节，及热中烦满，甚则为热毒，皆阴不足以化之之故也。气化布而至于水化行，则肾之阴气，周于胸，遍于关节，而诸热悉化矣。即斯义以求之，则兹味之用，应借其由阴化阳，即阳化阴之全功，（不只言其由阴化阳，却必言其由阳化阴，而后水脏之气化乃全。故水脏病不必其病于水者而亦用之，以其能益水脏之气化也，气化而血化亦原于是矣。然则兹味犹不得执水以求之，矧可以其行水为专功哉。）且于心肾为功最切。（如中风之轻脚丸，鹤膝之经进地仙丹，此多治肾脏病。谵妄之茯神散，此专治心脏病。可皆本于由阴化阳，即阳化阴者，变化以推求矣。）即概以为行水，亦非于阴水不宜也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614102029-pi25xyi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102029-pi25xyi","updated":"20240614102029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用赤小豆，病已即去，勿过剂。（仲淳）"}]},{"ID":"20240614102029-c8q6xev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102029-c8q6xev","updated":"20240614102029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"久服则降令太过，津血渗泄，令人肌瘦身重。（濒湖）"}]},{"ID":"20240614102029-m11kyu5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614102029-m11kyu5","updated":"20240614102029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔附余论〕上焦以阳为主，阳不得阴无以化，则天气不下济而穷于降。和于阴以化，即随阴而降，阳乃畅矣。下焦以阴为主，阴不得阳无以化，则地气不上行而穷于升。和于阳以化，即随阳而升，阴乃畅矣。第患于阳之不化而不能降，只议导气不可也。即苦寒降阳，亦属权宜。惟使金为火之用，则阳降矣。患于阴之不化而不能升，只欲化血不可也。即以辛热达阴，亦属权宜。惟使木为水之用，则阴升矣。顾脾胃气交也，水火借以升降，而脾胃亦赖水火以调。所谓金木者，生成之终始，岂不然哉。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101904-jlr3uug","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614101904-jlr3uug"}},{"ID":"20240614101916-gqrqo2l","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614101916-gqrqo2l","updated":"20240614101920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240614101916-gso8epv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101916-gso8epv","updated":"20240614101916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘酸，平，无毒。主下水，排痈肿脓血，寒热热中，消渴，止泻，利小便，吐逆猝 ，下胀满。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101904-jafup8p","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614101904-jafup8p"}},{"ID":"20240614101905-g8fvfij","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614101905-g8fvfij","updated":"20240614101911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614101905-qxxof42","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101905-qxxof42","updated":"20240614101905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘、酸，平，无毒。主下水，排痈肿脓血，寒热，热中，消渴，止泄，利小便，吐逆，卒疝，下胀满。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101905-npuchdx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101905-npuchdx","updated":"20240614101905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶大、小豆共条，犹如葱、薤义也。以大豆为 芽，生便干之，名为黄卷。用之亦熬，服食所须。煮大豆，主温毒水肿殊效。复有白大豆，不入药。小豆性逐津液，久服令人枯燥矣。唐本注云∶《别录》云，叶名藿，止小便数，去烦热。今按∶陈藏器本草云∶赤小豆和桑根白皮煮食之，主湿气痹肿。小豆和通草煮食之，当下气无限，名脱气丸。驴食脚轻，蜀本注云∶病酒热饮汁即愈。药性论云∶赤小豆，使，味甘。能消热毒痈肿，散恶血不尽，烦满，治水肿，皮肌胀满。捣薄涂痈肿上，主小儿急黄烂疮。取汁令人美食。末与鸡子白调，涂热毒痈肿瘥。通气，健脾胃。陈士良云∶赤小豆，微寒。缩气行风，抽肌肉。久食瘦人，坚筋骨，疗水气。解小麦热毒。日华子云∶赤豆粉，治烦解热毒，排脓，补血脉，解油衣粘缀甚妙。叶食之明目。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101905-f7g4hwb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101905-f7g4hwb","updated":"20240614101905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶赤小豆，旧与大豆同条，苏恭分之。今江淮间尤多种莳。主水气，香港脚方∶最急用。其法用此豆五合，葫一头，生姜一分，并碎破，商陆根一条，切，同水煮豆烂，汤成，适寒温腹食之，旋旋啜汁令尽，肿立消便止。韦宙《独行方》疗水肿，从脚起入腹则杀人。亦用赤小豆一斗，煮令极烂，取汁四、五升，温渍膝以下。若已入腹，但李绛《兵部手集方》亦着此法，云曾得效。昔有人患香港脚，用此豆作袋置足下，朝夕展转践踏之，其疾遂愈。亦主丹毒。《短剧方》以赤小豆末和鸡子白，消也。其遍体者，亦遍涂如上法。又诸肿毒欲作痈疽者，以水和往用之有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101905-yq3bt41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101905-yq3bt41","updated":"20240614101905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"食疗云∶和鲤鱼烂煮食之，甚治香港脚及大腹水肿。别有诸治，具在鱼条中。散气，去关节烦热。令人心孔开，止小便数。绿、赤者并可食。暴痢后，气满不能食，煮一顿服之即愈。千金方∶小豆三七枚，烧作屑，筛，冷水顿服之佳。肘后方∶辟温病。取小豆，新布囊盛之，置井中，三日出。举家服，男十枚，女二十枚。又方∶治肠痔，大便常血。小豆一升，苦酒五升，煮豆熟，出干，复纳法酒中，候酒尽止，末，酒服方寸匕，日三度又方∶舌上忽出血如簪孔。小豆一升，杵碎，水三升和，搅取汁饮。又方∶产后心闷目生赤小豆杵末，东流水服方寸匕。不瘥更服。梅师方∶治热毒下血，或因食热物发动。以寸匕。又方∶治妇人乳肿不得消。小豆、莽草等分，为末，苦酒和敷之豆酱合鱼 食之成口疮。食医心镜∶理脚肿满转上暖之。又方∶主小便数豆叶一斤，于豉汁中煮，调和作羹食之，煮粥亦佳。广利方∶治小儿火丹热如火，绕腰即损人，救急。杵赤小豆末，和鸡子白敷之，干即易。必效方∶治水谷痢。小豆一合，和蜡三两，醋敷之亦消。产宝治难产方∶赤小豆生吞七枚出，若是女，二七枚佳。产书云∶下乳汁。煮衍义曰∶赤小豆，食之行小便，久则虚人，令人黑瘦、枯燥，关西河北、京东、西多食之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101905-1l8wjie","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101905-1l8wjie","updated":"20240614101905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"花治宿酒，渴病。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101745-ec5qnx2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614101745-ec5qnx2"}},{"ID":"20240614101854-hvwcii1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614101854-hvwcii1","updated":"20240614101857"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆《长沙药解》"}]},{"ID":"20240614101854-tzpk206","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101854-tzpk206","updated":"20240614101854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经】大豆黄卷。味甘平。主湿痹，筋挛，膝痛。生大豆，涂痈肿。煮汁，饮，杀鬼毒，止痛。赤小豆，主下水，排痈肿脓血。生平泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101854-tsa273a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101854-tsa273a","updated":"20240614101854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，入手太阳小肠、足太阳膀胱经。利水而泻湿热，止血而消痈肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101854-1sqecnm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101854-1sqecnm","updated":"20240614101854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《金匮》"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"赤小豆当归散"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"赤小豆三升，当归十两。为散，浆水服方寸匕，日三服。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治狐惑脓成，脉数心烦，默默欲卧，目赤眦青，汗出能食。以湿旺木郁，郁而生热，湿热淫蒸，肉腐脓化。赤小豆利水而泻湿热，当归养血而排脓秽也。又治先血后便者。以土湿木遏，郁而生风，疏泄不藏，以致便血。其下在大便之先者，是缘肝血之陷漏，其来近也。赤小豆利水而泻湿热，当归养血而清风木也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101854-tegngil","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101854-tegngil","updated":"20240614101854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《伤寒》"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"瓜蒂散"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"方在瓜蒂。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用之，治胸有寒瘀，心中痞硬，气冲咽喉，以其涤胸中之湿淫也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101854-4txqtbv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101854-4txqtbv","updated":"20240614101854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄连翘赤小豆汤"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"方在连翘。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用之，治太阴病，瘀热在里，身必发黄，以其泻经络之湿邪也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101854-stp9h7w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101854-stp9h7w","updated":"20240614101854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆利水泻湿，行郁退热，安胎下乳，善治一切痈肿，及诸下血之病。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101854-5grqyls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101854-5grqyls","updated":"20240614101854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"浸令毛出，曝干用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101817-5kwujre","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614101817-5kwujre"}},{"ID":"20240614101843-jga4msz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614101843-jga4msz","updated":"20240614101846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240614101843-sej5zu2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101843-sej5zu2","updated":"20240614101843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆甘酸性平，腹肿香港脚热寒宁，止吐泻与卒下血，消渴痈疽亦有情。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101843-vue6lef","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101843-vue6lef","updated":"20240614101843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"色赤形小。无毒。阴中阳也。主下水，大腹水肿，皮肌胀满及香港脚肿满入腹，利小便，止小便数，除烦满寒热，止泻及吐逆卒 、肠痔下血及舌忽出血不止，消渴，大能解毒，排痈肿脓血，散恶血不尽。兼催难产，下乳汁及产后心闷烦满不食，乃行水通气健脾之剂。久服燥津，令人虚且黑瘦。入药炒用，捣末醋调，或鸡子清调敷疮肿乳肿丹毒，取汁洗小儿急黄烂疮。赤豆粉，治烦解热，补血脉，坚筋骨，解小麦热毒。叶，食之明目。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101843-dkocnrt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101843-dkocnrt","updated":"20240614101843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"花，味辛，平，有腐气，故名腐婢。主下水气， 疟，寒热邪气，散气满不能食，止泻痢，明眼目，起阴气，止消渴，酒病头痛，兼治小儿丹毒热肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101817-2ucxppq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614101817-2ucxppq"}},{"ID":"20240614101831-hy406by","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614101831-hy406by","updated":"20240614101835"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240614101831-g7w2k5d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101831-g7w2k5d","updated":"20240614101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」赤豆、红豆，叶名藿"}]},{"ID":"20240614101831-hqsqwvk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101831-hqsqwvk","updated":"20240614101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240614101831-c5whetv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101831-c5whetv","updated":"20240614101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、水气肿胀。和赤小豆五合、大蒜一颗、生姜五钱、商陆根一条，一起碎破，同水煮烂，去药，空心食豆，慢慢饮汁令尽，肿立消。又方：用赤小豆一斗煮极烂，取汁五升，乘热浸泡脚和膝。若肿已到腹部，只须吃小豆即可。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101831-w4393nh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101831-w4393nh","updated":"20240614101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、痢疾。用小豆一合、熔蜡三两，一次服下，有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101831-pn3p2vn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101831-pn3p2vn","updated":"20240614101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、肠痔下血。用小豆三升、苦酒五升，煮熟晒干，再浸至酒尽乃止，然后研豆为末。每服一钱，酒送下。一天服三次。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101831-l94an9w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101831-l94an9w","updated":"20240614101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、牙齿疼痛。用赤小豆擦牙吐涎及吹鼻中。一方：加阿青少许。一方：加花咸少许。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101831-lj59k7e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101831-lj59k7e","updated":"20240614101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、乳汁不通。用赤小豆煮汁饮之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101831-dejm88j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101831-dejm88j","updated":"20240614101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、前疽初作。用赤小豆末调水敷涂。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101831-i624mcl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101831-i624mcl","updated":"20240614101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、肋颊热肿。用赤小豆和蜜敷涂，一夜即消。或加芙蓉叶末更好。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101831-x8uq4o1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101831-x8uq4o1","updated":"20240614101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、丹毒如火。用赤小豆末调鸡蛋白，随时敷涂。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101831-jz9os9b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101831-jz9os9b","updated":"20240614101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9、小便频数。用小豆叶一斤，在豉汁中煮成汤吃下。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101831-gcg9zba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101831-gcg9zba","updated":"20240614101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10、小儿遗尿。用小豆叶捣汁服下。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101817-5lbmy2z","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614101817-5lbmy2z"}},{"ID":"20240614101818-gdmwxc7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614101818-gdmwxc7","updated":"20240614101824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆《本草新编》"}]},{"ID":"20240614101818-7qqatyy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101818-7qqatyy","updated":"20240614101818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆，味辛、甘、酸，气温而平，阴中之阳，无毒。入脾经。下水，治黄烂疮，解酒醉，燥湿浸手足肿大，疗香港脚入脐高突。但专利水逐津，久服令人枯燥，亦可暂用以利水，而不可久用以渗湿。湿症多属气虚，气虚利水，转利转虚，而湿愈不能去矣，况赤小豆专利下体之水，而不能利上身之湿。盖下体之湿，真湿也，用之而效。上身之湿，虚湿也，用之而益甚，不可不辨也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101818-hx27kez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101818-hx27kez","updated":"20240614101818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或问赤小豆，即家园之红豆乎？曰∶别是一种，其色如朱而发光，头上一点黑如漆。若家园之红豆，名曰红，而色实紫，能疗饥，而不能利水去湿，多食亦败血，功用与赤小豆迥别。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101818-mxeobkz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101818-mxeobkz","updated":"20240614101818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"切勿以家园之红豆，而错用之也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101745-piatc8h","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614101745-piatc8h"}},{"ID":"20240614101807-4qoyif9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614101807-4qoyif9","updated":"20240614101812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆《本草备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240614101807-qwwtsgn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101807-qwwtsgn","updated":"20240614101807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通，行水，散血。十剂作燥"}]},{"ID":"20240614101807-cytyy33","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101807-cytyy33","updated":"20240614101807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘酸（思邈∶咸冷）。色赤，心之谷也。性下行，通小肠，利小便（心与小肠相表里），行水散血，消肿排脓，清热解毒。治泻痢香港脚（昔有患香港脚者，用袋盛赤小豆，朝夕践踏之，遂愈。同鲤鱼煮汁食，能消水肿，煮粥亦佳），敷一切疮疽（鸡子白调末箍之，性极粘，干则难揭，入苎根末则不粘。宋仁宗患 腮，道士赞能，取赤小豆四十九粒咒之，杂他药敷之而愈。中贵任承亮亲见，后任自患恶疮，付永投以药立愈。问之∶赤小豆也。承亮始悟道士之咒伪也。后过豫章，见医治胁疽甚捷，任曰∶莫非赤小豆耶？医惊拜曰∶用此活三十余口，愿勿复宣），止渴解酒，通乳下胎。然渗津液，久服令人枯瘦（《十剂》曰∶燥可去湿，桑白皮、赤小豆之属是也。按∶二药未可言燥，盖取其行水之功，然以木通，防己为通剂，通、燥二义似重。故本集改热药为燥剂，而以行水为通剂）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101746-ww8c1im","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614101746-ww8c1im"}},{"ID":"20240614101756-x2h7zwu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614101756-x2h7zwu","updated":"20240614101801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆《本草择要纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240614101756-cjlfay1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101756-cjlfay1","updated":"20240614101756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（俗呼红豆．以紧小而赤黯色者入药．其稍大而鲜红淡红色者并不治病．）"}]},{"ID":"20240614101756-ykgn3b0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101756-ykgn3b0","updated":"20240614101756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】"}]},{"ID":"20240614101756-h5mtr9f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101756-h5mtr9f","updated":"20240614101756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘酸平无毒．"}]},{"ID":"20240614101756-311ihjd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101756-311ihjd","updated":"20240614101756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240614101756-gg2adzq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101756-gg2adzq","updated":"20240614101756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆而色赤心之谷也．其性下行．通乎小肠．能入阴分．治有形之病．故行津液．利小便．消胀除肿．止吐而治下痢肠 ．解酒病．除寒热痈肿．排脓散血而通乳汁．下胞衣产难．皆病之有形者久服则降令太过．津血渗泄．所以令人肌瘦身重也．其吹鼻瓜蒂散及辟瘟疫用之．亦取其通气除湿散热耳．水气香港脚最为急用．今之治水者．惟知治水．而不知补胃则失之壅滞．赤小豆消水通气而健脾胃乃其药也．"}]},{"ID":"20240614101746-hfr8g7q","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614101746-hfr8g7q"}},{"ID":"20240614101747-k8qvih4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614101747-k8qvih4","updated":"20240614101751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240614101747-1vgru2u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101747-1vgru2u","updated":"20240614101747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，酸，平，温，无毒．主治寒热、热中、消渴，止泄，利小便，吐逆，卒 ，满．又，叶名藿，主治小便数，去烦热．"}]},{"ID":"20240614101747-qggldvg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101747-qggldvg","updated":"20240614101747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶赤小豆，主下水，排痈肿脓血．生平泽．"}]},{"ID":"20240614101447-dr7j5gb","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614101447-dr7j5gb"}},{"ID":"20240614101737-d335y8f","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614101737-d335y8f","updated":"20240614101740"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240614101737-6plmvma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101737-6plmvma","updated":"20240614101737"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"通、行水散血．"}]},{"ID":"20240614101737-btwyh15","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101737-btwyh15","updated":"20240614101737"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘酸平．色赤．心之谷也．性下行而通小肠．（心与小肠相为表里、行水．同鲤鱼煮食、能消水肿、煮粥亦佳．）散血消肿．排脓清热解毒．治泻痢呕吐香港脚．（昔有患香港脚者、用赤小豆袋盛、朝夕践踏之、遂愈．）敷一切疮疽．（鸡子白调末箍之、性极粘、干则难揭、入苎根末则不粘、宋仁宗患 腮、道士赞宁、取赤小豆四十九粒咒之、杂他药敷之而愈、中贵任承亮所亲见、后任自患恶疮、傅永授以药、立愈、问之、赤小豆也、承亮始悟道士之咒伪也、后过豫章、见医治胁疽甚捷、任曰∶莫非赤小豆耶、医惊拜曰∶予用此活三十余口、愿勿复宣、凡溃烂几绝者、为末敷之、无不立效．）止渴解酒．通乳汁．下胞胎．最渗津液．久服令人枯瘦身重．（十剂曰∶燥可去湿、桑白皮赤小豆之属是也．）以紧小而赤黯色者入药．"}]},{"ID":"20240614101737-l7yuy7f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101737-l7yuy7f","updated":"20240614101737"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其稍大而鲜红淡红色者．并不治病．今肆中半粒红半粒黑者．是相思子．（一名红豆、苦平有毒、吐心腹邪气、风痰瘴疟、虫蛊毒、研二七枚服．）"}]},{"ID":"20240614101447-pltpjkq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614101447-pltpjkq"}},{"ID":"20240614101726-yi15t0z","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614101726-yi15t0z","updated":"20240614101731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆《本草便读》"}]},{"ID":"20240614101726-7mjysna","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101726-7mjysna","updated":"20240614101726"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"能通心与小肠．行瘀利水．可排脓而散肿．治豉消瘅．味甘微酸．性平无毒．绿豆甘寒专解毒．蠲除水热并和脾．其色可以入肝．其治似疑归胃．（赤小豆即今之杜赤豆．以紧小色赤者为佳．今药店中之赤小豆．半红半黑．谓之相思子．即红豆也．有毒不堪用．杜赤豆之性．甘酸而平．入心与小肠．功专消水行血．故内而水鼓血鼓．以及一切香港脚．外而痈疽肿毒．或服或敷．皆有神效．然总不过消水行血之功．古人言其多食令人消瘦者．概可想见矣．"}]},{"ID":"20240614101726-110ywoq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101726-110ywoq","updated":"20240614101726"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"○绿豆味甘性寒．行水之功．相同赤豆．而清热解毒．惟此为胜．故一切丹石诸毒．皆可解之．且能浓肠胃．非如赤豆之能令人消瘦也．）"}]},{"ID":"20240614101703-yevktfg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614101703-yevktfg"}},{"ID":"20240614101715-72pm9uy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614101715-72pm9uy","updated":"20240614101721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240614101715-akfxrud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101715-akfxrud","updated":"20240614101715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味甘酸平，无毒。主下水肿，排痈肿脓血。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101715-z19pi49","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101715-z19pi49","updated":"20240614101715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（赤豆出江淮间，今关西、河北、汴洛皆有，夏至后下种，苗科高尺许，枝叶似豇豆，至秋开花淡银褐色，有腐气，结荚长二三寸，皮色微白带红，豆如绿豆而色赤，可作粥饭，煮熟 黯，可作香豉入药，以紧小而赤黯者为良。豆谷类也，赤小豆乃赤豆之小者，今药肆中知以何物，草子赤黑相间者，伪充赤小豆，其谬已甚。夫既名为豆，岂可于谷外求之耶。）"}]},{"ID":"20240614101715-q5t688e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101715-q5t688e","updated":"20240614101715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤豆煮熟，其味则甘，生时其气微酸，故曰甘酸平。豆者，水之谷也，其性下沉，是主从上属火，又主从下而上，由内而外。《本经》主下水肿，乃从上而下，由外而内也。排痈肿脓血，乃从下而上，由内而外矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101704-k0aa5ol","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614101704-k0aa5ol"}},{"ID":"20240614101705-e89fmva","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614101705-e89fmva","updated":"20240614101710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆《增广和剂局方药性总论》"}]},{"ID":"20240614101705-i8tiq1h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101705-i8tiq1h","updated":"20240614101705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘酸，平，无毒。主下水，排痈肿脓血，寒热，热中，消渴，止泄，利小便，吐逆，猝，下胀满。《药性论》云∶使。能消热毒痈肿，散恶血不尽，烦满，治水肿，主黄，烂疮。末与鸡子白调涂热毒痈肿瘥，通气，健脾胃。日华子云∶赤豆粉治烦，解热毒，排脓，补血脉，解油衣粘缀。叶∶明目。一云∶昔有人患香港脚，用此作袋，置足下朝夕展转践踏之，其疾遂愈。亦主丹毒，涂之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101448-jkv8r3y","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614101448-jkv8r3y"}},{"ID":"20240614101655-bqkg7t1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614101655-bqkg7t1","updated":"20240614101700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆《本草分经》"}]},{"ID":"20240614101655-ois60ii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101655-ois60ii","updated":"20240614101655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘酸平，色赤入心，性下行而通小肠，行水散血，清热解毒敷疮，通乳汁下胞胎，最渗精液不宜久服。相思子苦平，研服，能吐邪气及蛊毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101448-jb3n442","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614101448-jb3n442"}},{"ID":"20240614101637-x3y4fad","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614101637-x3y4fad","updated":"20240614101650"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆《要药分剂》"}]},{"ID":"20240614101637-x6ksf6a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101637-x6ksf6a","updated":"20240614101637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛。性平。无毒。禀秋燥之气以生。阴中阳也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101637-y9w6xrb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101637-y9w6xrb","updated":"20240614101637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主下水。排痈肿脓血。（本经）寒热。热中。消渴。止泄痢。利小便。吐逆猝。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101637-utqs5j5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101637-utqs5j5","updated":"20240614101637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（别录）下水肿胀满。解小麦毒。（汤液）散气。去关节烦热。令人心孔开。暴痢后气满不能食【归经】入心经。兼入小肠经。为行水散血之品。（兼燥剂水气香港脚最为急用）【前论】海藏曰。治水而不转胃。则失之壅滞。赤小豆消水通气而健脾胃。乃其药也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101637-wyuqppc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101637-wyuqppc","updated":"20240614101637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"时珍【禁忌】纲目曰。久服则降令太过。津血渗泄。令人肌瘦身重。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101448-yv3i61x","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614101448-yv3i61x"}},{"ID":"20240614101503-dfr0sgt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614101503-dfr0sgt","updated":"20240614101632"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆《中药学》"}]},{"ID":"20240614101503-15403hs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101503-15403hs","updated":"20240614101503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药用】豆科本草植物赤小豆PhaseoluscalcartusRoxb.或赤豆P.angularis Wight的成熟种子。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101503-sete57k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101503-sete57k","updated":"20240614101503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味与归经】甘、酸，平。归心、小肠经。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101503-525pg98","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101503-525pg98","updated":"20240614101503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功效】利水消肿，利湿退黄，消肿排脓。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101503-cmsrc9f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101503-cmsrc9f","updated":"20240614101503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】1.用于水肿，脚气等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101503-ojmlqnt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101503-ojmlqnt","updated":"20240614101503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆性善于下行，通利水道，使水湿下泄而消肿，故适用于水肿胀满、脚气浮肿等症。可单味煎服，或与猪苓、泽泻、茯苓皮等药配伍同用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101503-yfkpgkr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101503-yfkpgkr","updated":"20240614101503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.用于湿热黄疸。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101503-brmt9f0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101503-brmt9f0","updated":"20240614101503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤小豆能清热利湿退黄，用于湿热黄疸轻症，可与麻黄、连翘、桑白皮等同用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101503-68kgxjw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101503-68kgxjw","updated":"20240614101503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.用于疮疡肿痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101503-ogj032m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101503-ogj032m","updated":"20240614101503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品能消肿排脓，故可用于于疮疡肿毒之症，可配赤芍、连翘等煎汁内服，亦可配芙蓉叶、陈小粉，研末外敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101503-lawulu1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101503-lawulu1","updated":"20240614101503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【处方用名】赤小豆、野赤豆、杜赤豆、饭赤豆（洗净，晒干，打碎用）"}]},{"ID":"20240614101503-qncs7kl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101503-qncs7kl","updated":"20240614101503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【一般用量与用法】三钱至一两，煎服。外用适量。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101503-2l2d06j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101503-2l2d06j","updated":"20240614101503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【方剂举例】麻黄连翘赤小豆汤（《伤寒论》）：麻黄、连翘、赤小豆、生梓白皮、杏仁、生姜、大枣。治湿热黄疸轻症，身发黄，发热无汗。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101503-4se63y6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101503-4se63y6","updated":"20240614101503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【文献摘录】《名医别录》：「主寒热，热中，消渴，止泻，利小便，吐逆，卒澼，下胀满。」"}]},{"ID":"20240614101503-t6qoiqt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101503-t6qoiqt","updated":"20240614101503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《药性论》：「消热毒痈肿，散恶血不尽、烦满。治水肿，皮肌胀满；捣薄涂痈肿上；主小儿急黄，烂疮，取汁令洗之；能令人美食；末与鸡子白调涂热毒疮肿；通气，健脾胃。」"}]},{"ID":"20240614101503-3svut9z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101503-3svut9z","updated":"20240614101503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草经疏》：「凡水肿、胀满、泄泻，皆湿气伤脾所致，小豆健脾燥湿，故主下水肿胀满，止泻，利小便也。」"}]},{"ID":"20240614101448-fvs3ehw","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614101448-fvs3ehw"}},{"ID":"20240614101449-i44ce1l","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-i44ce1l","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中国药典》：赤小豆"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-s51kvut","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-s51kvut","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-wdwy0gr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-wdwy0gr","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Chì Xiǎo Dòu"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-2iqxn1w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-2iqxn1w","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-y6p7pt2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-y6p7pt2","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 赤豆、红小豆"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-3i5e80v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-3i5e80v","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-wfkvvji","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-wfkvvji","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" SEMEN PHASEOLI"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-reltbkf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-reltbkf","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-396gx06","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-396gx06","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为豆科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"赤小豆"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Phaseolus calcaratus Roxb. 或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"赤豆"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Phaseolus angularis Wight的干燥"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"成熟种子"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。秋季果实成熟而未开裂时拔取全株，晒干，打下种子，除去杂质， 再晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-p6z0mzz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-p6z0mzz","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-jckqzzo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-jckqzzo","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 赤小豆：呈长圆形而稍扁，长5～8mm，直径3～5mm。表面紫红色，无光泽或微有光泽；一侧有线形突起的种脐，偏向一端，白色，约为全长2/3，中间凹陷成纵沟；另侧有1条不明显的棱脊。质硬，不易破碎，子叶2，乳白色。无臭，味微甘。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-k99v0k3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-k99v0k3","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤豆：呈短圆柱形，两端较平截或钝圆，直径4～6mm。表面暗棕红色，有光泽，种脐不突起。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-pqtkq2p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-pqtkq2p","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贮藏"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-0em8a8y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-0em8a8y","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 置干燥处，防蛀。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-noyh672","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-noyh672","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-k89s2pd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-k89s2pd","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品横切面：赤小豆 种皮表皮为1 列栅状细胞，种脐处2 列，细胞内含淡红棕色物，光辉带明显。支柱细胞1 列，呈哑铃状，其下为10列薄壁细胞，内侧细胞呈颓废状。子叶细胞含众多淀粉粒，并含有细小草酸钙方晶和簇晶。种脐部位栅状细胞的外侧有种阜，内侧有管胞岛，椭圆形，细胞壁网状增厚，其两侧为星状组织，细胞呈星芒状，有大形细胞间隙。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-01r9il1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-01r9il1","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赤豆 子叶细胞偶见细小草酸钙方晶，不含簇晶。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-omxbon7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-omxbon7","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-yoe0d61","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-yoe0d61","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归心、小肠经。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-kw52g9o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-kw52g9o","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-7zyx00k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-7zyx00k","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘、酸，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-uia1k8b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-uia1k8b","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-pf85cpr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-pf85cpr","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 利水消肿，解毒排脓。用于水肿胀满，脚气肢肿，黄疸尿赤，风湿热痹，痈肿疮毒，肠痈腹痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-yhzyp10","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-yhzyp10","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-1icirou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-1icirou","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 9～30g。外用适量，研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-eey05ma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-eey05ma","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"备注"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-l3418lp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-l3418lp","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" （1）用于水肿胀满、脚气浮肿等症。可单味煎服，或与猪苓、泽泻、茯苓皮等药配伍同用。用于湿热黄疸轻症，可与麻黄、连翘、桑白皮等同用。用于于疮疡肿毒之症，可配赤芍、连翘等煎汁内服，亦可配芙蓉叶、陈小粉，研末外敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-qfex98k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-qfex98k","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）药用的赤小豆习惯上认为以前者为优，南方一般多用种子较窄的赤小豆，而不用较肥圆的赤小豆。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-pbgtmjb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-pbgtmjb","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-3aorbgz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-3aorbgz","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-9pqlwoe","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-9pqlwoe","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：赤小豆"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-cd8v088","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-cd8v088","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-8lehy8w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-8lehy8w","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Chì Xiǎo Dòu"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-i2ke536","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-i2ke536","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-3w1sxwg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-3w1sxwg","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 亦豆（《日华子本草》），红豆（《纲目》），红小豆（《本草原始》），小红绿豆、虱拇豆（《陆川本草》），朱赤豆（《中药材手册》），金红小豆、朱小豆（《药材学》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-scu8mli","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-scu8mli","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-bnpthwb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-bnpthwb","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-436nlfk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-436nlfk","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-q77byxo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-q77byxo","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为豆科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"赤小豆"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"赤豆"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"种子"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。夏、秋分批采摘成熟荚果，晒干，打出种子，除去杂质，再晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-tmogz4e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-tmogz4e","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-bpjgzrp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-bpjgzrp","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①赤小豆，又名：猪肝赤（《本经逢原》），杜赤豆（《本草便读》），米赤豆、茅柴赤、米赤。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-2n6h9a3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-2n6h9a3","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一年生半攀援草本。茎长可达1.8米，密被倒毛。3出复叶，叶柄长8～16厘米；托叶披针形或卵状披针形；小叶3枚，披针形、矩圆状披针形至卵状披针形，长6～10厘米，宽2～6厘米，先端渐尖，基部阔三角形或近圆形，全缘或具3浅裂，两面均无毛，仅叶脉上有疏毛，纸质，脉3出，具柄。总状花序腋生，小花多枚，小花柄极短；小苞2枚，披针状线形，长约5毫米，具毛；花萼短钟状，萼齿5；花冠蝶形，黄色，旗瓣肾形，顶面中央微凹，基部心形，翼瓣斜卵形，基部具渐狭的爪，龙骨瓣狭长，有角状突起；雄蕊10，两体，花药小；子房上位，密被短硬毛，花柱线形。荚果线状扁圆柱形；种子6～10枚，暗紫色，长圆形，两端圆，有直而凹陷的种脐。花期5～8月。果期8～9月。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-xsmsndf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-xsmsndf","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培或野生。分布广东、广西、江西及上海郊区等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-kw3obhu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-kw3obhu","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②赤豆，又名：红饭豆（《增订伪药条辨》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-z1etqmq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-z1etqmq","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一年生直立草本，高30～90厘米。茎上有硬毛。3出复叶；托叶线形，被白色长柔毛；小叶卵形至斜方状卵形，长5～10厘米，宽3.5～7厘米，先端短尖或渐尖，基部三角形或近圆形，全缘或极浅3裂，两面被疏长毛。花2～6朵，着生于腋生的总花梗顶端；蝶形花，形与上种相同；荚果扁圆筒状，于种子间收缩，无毛；种子6～10粒，暗红色，矩圆形，两端截形或圆形，种脐不凹。花期6～7月。果期7～8月。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-opj0tbb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-opj0tbb","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"全国各地广为栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-r30p12s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-r30p12s","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-2xueioi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-2xueioi","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①赤小豆：干燥种子略呈圆柱形而稍扁，长5～7毫米，直径约3毫米，种皮赤褐色或紫褐色，平滑，微有光泽，种脐线形，白色，约为全长的2／3，中间凹陷成一纵沟，偏向一端，背面有一条不明显的棱脊。质坚硬，不易破碎，除去种皮，可见两瓣乳白色于仁。气微，嚼之有豆腥味。以身干，颗粒饱满，色赤红发暗者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-zeqiixl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-zeqiixl","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主产广东、广西、江西等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-dh06who","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-dh06who","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②赤豆：又名饭赤豆。干燥种子，呈矩圆形，两端圆钝或平截，长5～8毫米，直径约4～6毫米，种皮赤褐色或稍淡，平滑有光泽，种脐位于侧缘上端，白色，不显着突出，亦不凹陷；其他性状与亦小豆相似。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-m0kyltk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-m0kyltk","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"全国大部分地区均产。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-484erkd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-484erkd","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材以赤小豆品质为好，但货源不多，渐为赤豆所代替。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-nxim6qk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-nxim6qk","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-h9nozia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-h9nozia","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 每百克含蛋白质20.7克、脂肪0.5克、碳水化物58克、粗纤维4.9克、灰分3.3克、钙67毫克、磷305毫克、铁5.2毫克、硫胺素0.31毫克、核黄素0.11毫克、尼克酸2.7毫克。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-ty1eqzn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-ty1eqzn","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-lfzqn77","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-lfzqn77","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入心、小肠经。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-m6zrevy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-m6zrevy","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《雷公炮制药性解》：\"入心经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-sqc3p8q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-sqc3p8q","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草新编》：\"入脾经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-j3zrym5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-j3zrym5","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《得配本草》：\"入手少阴、太阳经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-3bqrn5d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-3bqrn5d","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草再新》：\"入心、肺二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-lxqzi4q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-lxqzi4q","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-f83z7ln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-f83z7ln","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘酸，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-c02sopf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-c02sopf","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《养生要集》：\"味苦，温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-vyenicv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-vyenicv","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"甘酸，平，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-qr51vxt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-qr51vxt","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《千金·食治》：\"甘咸，平，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-8x6z9dm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-8x6z9dm","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《食性本草》：\"微寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-3sshmgo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-3sshmgo","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《汤液本草》：\"气温，味辛甘酸，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-vrg4wqq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-vrg4wqq","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-p6p729m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-p6p729m","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①陶弘景：\"性逐津液，久食令人枯燥。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-tf4cdl2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-tf4cdl2","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《食性本草》：\"久食瘦人。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-30840lq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-30840lq","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《随息居饮食谱》：\"蛇咬者百日内忌之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-o21n41n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-o21n41n","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-b1a1cye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-b1a1cye","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 利水除湿，和血排脓，消肿解毒。治水肿，脚气，黄疸，泻痢，便血，痈肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-jqtfqh0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-jqtfqh0","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主下水，排痈肿脓血。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-58cad54","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-58cad54","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"主寒热，热中，消渴，止泄，利小便，吐逆，卒澼，下胀满。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-kko57gl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-kko57gl","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"消热毒痈肿，散恶血、不尽、烦满。治水肿皮肌胀满；捣薄涂痈肿上；主小儿急黄、烂疮，取汁令洗之；能令人美食；末与鸡子白调涂热毒痈肿；通气，健脾胃。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-exj324l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-exj324l","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《食疗本草》：\"和鲤鱼烂煮食之，甚治脚气及大腹水肿；散气，去关节烦热，令人心孔开，止小便数；绿赤者，并可食。暴利后气满不能食，煮一顿服之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-3ucydrt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-3ucydrt","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《蜀本草》：\"病酒热，饮汁。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-yxsrc7l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-yxsrc7l","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《食性本草》；\"坚筋骨，疗水气，解小麦热毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-45cgb7s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-45cgb7s","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《日华子本草》：\"赤豆粉，治烦，解热毒，排脓，补血脉。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-qid6wp6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-qid6wp6","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《纲目》：\"辟温疫，治产难，下胞衣，通乳汁。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-ki38ssm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-ki38ssm","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨《本草再新》：\"清热和血，利水通经，宽肠理气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-85njnqi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-85njnqi","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-3d1z1vo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-3d1z1vo","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，0.3～1两；或入散剂。外用：生研调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-oyovrpg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-oyovrpg","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-u96dah1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-u96dah1","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治水肿坐卧不得，头面身体悉肿：桑枝烧灰、淋汁，煮赤小豆空心食令饱，饥即食尽，不得吃饭。（《梅师集验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-ue0xgdt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-ue0xgdt","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治卒大腹水病：白茅根一大把，小豆三升，煮取干，去茅根食豆，水随小便下。（《补缺肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-txv9tww","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-txv9tww","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治水肿从脚起，入腹则杀人：赤小豆一升，煮令极烂，取汁四、五升，温渍膝以下；若已入腹，但服小豆，勿杂食。（《独行方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-5r16vj7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-5r16vj7","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治脚气：赤小豆五合，葫一头，生姜一分（并破碎），商陆根一条（切）。同水煮，豆烂汤成，适寒温，去葫等，细嚼豆，空腹食之，旋旋啜汁令尽。（《本草图经》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-p4bki28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-p4bki28","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治脚气气急，大小便涩，通身肿，两脚气胀，变成水者：赤小豆半升，桑根白皮（炙，锉）二两，紫苏茎叶一握（锉，焙）。上三味除小豆外，捣罗为末。每服先以豆一合，用水五盏煮熟，去豆，取汁二盏半，入药末四钱匕，生姜一分，拍碎，煎至一盏半，空心温服，然后择取豆任意食，日再。（《圣济总录》赤小豆汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-lwxlu9p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-lwxlu9p","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治伤寒瘀热在里，身必黄：麻黄二两（去节），连轺二两，赤小豆一升，杏仁四十个（去皮、尖），大枣十二枚（擘），生梓白皮（切）一升，生姜二两（切），甘草二两（炙）。上八味，以水一斗，先煮麻黄再沸，去上沫，纳诸药，煮取三升，去滓，分温三服，半日服尽。（《伤寒论》麻黄连轺赤小豆汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-3uxmfk9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-3uxmfk9","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治急黄身如金色：赤小豆一两，丁香一分，黍米一分，瓜蒂半分，熏陆香一钱，青布五寸（烧灰），麝香一钱（细研）。上药捣细罗为散，都研令匀。每服不计时候，以清粥饮调下一钱；若用少许吹鼻中，当下黄水。（《圣惠方》赤小豆散）"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-ctlv05v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-ctlv05v","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治肠痔大便常血：小豆一升，苦酒五升，煮豆熟，出干，复纳清酒中，候酒尽止，末。酒服方寸匕，日三度。（《肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-3k3new7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-3k3new7","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治热毒下血，或因食热物发动：赤小豆杵末，水调下方寸匕。（《梅师集验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-cyhhs1m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-cyhhs1m","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治疽初作：小豆末醋敷之，亦消。（《小品方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-zc2yaqu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-zc2yaqu","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治大小肠痈，湿热气滞瘀凝所致：赤小豆、薏苡仁、防己、甘草，煎汤服。（《疡科捷径》赤豆薏苡汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-hxptvh8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-hxptvh8","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿治小儿天火丹，肉中有赤如丹色，大者如手，甚者遍身，或痛或痒或肿：赤小豆二升。末之，鸡子白和如薄泥敷之，干则易。一切丹并用此方。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-az5wtd4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-az5wtd4","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀治腮颊热肿：赤小豆末和蜜涂之，或加芙蓉叶末。（《纲目》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-2wg1h09","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-2wg1h09","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒁治小儿重舌：赤小豆末，醋和涂舌上。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-4nn8dub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-4nn8dub","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒂治舌上忽出血，如簪孔：小豆一升，杵碎，水三升，和搅取汁饮。（《肘后方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-s6kdwf2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-s6kdwf2","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒃下乳汁：煮赤小豆取汁饮。（《产书方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-hoepwfd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-hoepwfd","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒄治妇人吹奶：赤小豆酒研，温服，以滓敷之。（《妇人良方补遗》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-ahmjm3n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-ahmjm3n","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒅治风瘙瘾疹：赤小豆、荆芥穗等分，为末，鸡子清调涂之。（《纲目》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-o6dcmc6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-o6dcmc6","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒆治食六畜肉中毒：烧小豆一升，末，服三方寸匕。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-bfks62h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-bfks62h","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-nyveeqa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-nyveeqa","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治疗流行性腮腺炎"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-rz3jbow","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-rz3jbow","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取赤小豆50～70粒研成细粉，和入温水、鸡蛋清或蜜调成稀糊状，摊在布上，敷于患处。一般一次即能消肿。治疗7例，均获效果。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-dagxsaa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-dagxsaa","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治疗肝硬化腹水"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-unfqu0n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-unfqu0n","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取赤小豆1斤，活鲤鱼1条（重1斤以上），同放锅内，加水2000～3000毫升清炖，至赤小豆烂透为止。将赤小豆、鱼和汤分数次服下。每日或隔日1剂。连续服用，以愈为止。治疗2例，服后尿量增加，腹围减小，精神良好，无不良反应。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-2brkipe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-2brkipe","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-t6xfa8c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-t6xfa8c","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-e9svd2y","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-e9svd2y","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：赤小豆"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-7h5sq9t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-7h5sq9t","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-zfbms1p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-zfbms1p","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Chì Xiǎo Dòu"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-4n4jxb3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-4n4jxb3","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-kxcc3xl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-kxcc3xl","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 小豆、赤豆、红豆、红小豆、猪肝赤、杜赤豆、小红绿豆、虱牳豆、朱赤豆、金红小豆、朱小豆、茅柴赤、米赤豆。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-ist53qp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-ist53qp","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-fovlg9o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-fovlg9o","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Rice Bean"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-3rjfpl4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-3rjfpl4","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-ap1kjdf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-ap1kjdf","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-v2y241o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-v2y241o","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草纲目》：赤小豆以紧小而赤黯色者入药，其稍大而鲜红淡色者，并不治病。此药治一切痈疽疮疥及赤肿，不拘善恶，但水调敷之，无不愈者。但其性粘，干则难揭，若入苎根末即不粘，此法尤佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-z4q6uo1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-z4q6uo1","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-nrtq9x2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-nrtq9x2","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为豆科植物赤小豆或赤豆的种子。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-jywh8zp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-jywh8zp","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.Vigna umbellata （Thunb.）Ohwi et Ohashi[Dolichos umbellatus Thunb.；phaseolus calcaratus Roxb.]2.Vigna angularis （Willd.）Owhwi et Ohashi [Dolichos angularis Willd.；Phaseolus （Willd.）W.F.Wight]"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-7nxzlye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-7nxzlye","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：秋季荚果成熟而未开裂时拔取全株，晒干并打下种子，去杂质，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-svpkvd5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-svpkvd5","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-n414dxs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-n414dxs","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：栽培或野生。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-ue6nqsl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-ue6nqsl","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.分布于浙江、江西、湖南、广东、广西、贵州、云南等地。南方各地普遍栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-lcb1spr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-lcb1spr","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.全国广为栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-debpzzs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-debpzzs","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-cpfuzq0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-cpfuzq0","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.赤小豆 一年生半攀援草本。茎长可达1.8m，密被倒毛。三出复叶；叶柄长8-16cm；托叶披针形或卵状披针形；小叶3枚，被针形、长圆状披针形，长6-10cm，宽2-6cm，先端渐尖，基部阔三角形或近圆形，全缘或具3浅裂，两面均无毛，纸质；小叶具柄，脉3出。总状花序腋生，小花多枚，花柄极短；小苞2枚，披针状线形，长约5mm，具毛；萼短钟状，萼齿5；花冠蝶形，黄色，旗瓣肾形，顶面中央微凹，基部心形，翼瓣斜卵形，基部具渐狭的爪，龙骨瓣狭长，有角状突起；雄蕊10，二体，花药小；子房上位，密被短硬毛，花柱线形。荚果线状扁圆柱形。种子6-10颗，暗紫色，长圆形，两端圆，有直而凹陷的种脐。花期5-8月，果期8-9月。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-wdh8h0r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-wdh8h0r","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2．赤豆 一年生直立草本，高30-90cm。茎上有白色长硬毛。三出复叶；托叶披针形，被白色长柔毛，小托叶线形；叶柄长达20cm，被疏长毛；顶生小叶卵形，例生小叶斜方状卵形，长5-10cm，宽3.5-7cm，先端短尖或渐尖，基部三角形或近圆形，全缘或微3裂，两面被疏长毛；小叶柄很短；基出脉3条。花2-6朵，着生于腋生的总花梗顶部，黄色；小苞片线形，较萼长；萼钟状，5齿裂，萼齿三角形；旗瓣扁圆形或近肾形，常稍歪斜，顶端凹，翼瓣宽于龙骨瓣，具短爪及耳，龙骨瓣上端弯曲近半卷，其中一片在中下部有一角状突起，基部有爪；雄蕊10枚，分成9与1二体；于房线形，花柱弯曲，近先端有毛。荚果圆柱形稍扁，成熟时种子间缢缩，含种子6-10粒。种子椭圆形，两端截形或圆形，暗红色，种脐白色，不凹。花期7-8月，果期8-9月。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-tbn5ve1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-tbn5ve1","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-3d8aq9a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-3d8aq9a","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生物学特性 赤小豆适应性强，一般农田都可栽种。以向阳，土壤疏松，中等肥力（过肥易徒长，结荚少）为好，不宜连作。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-kwbsiff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-kwbsiff","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培技术 用种子繁殖：4月上旬至5月上、中旬播种，开1.3m宽的高畦，按行距各33cm开窝，每窝播种子5-6粒，lhm2用种子量22.5-30kg，播后盖人畜粪水排湿的火灰1把。可与其他作物如甘薯间作，也可在果园空闲地上点播。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-y5xgn0v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-y5xgn0v","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田间管理 苗高8-10cm时，中耕除草1次，并施人畜粪水拌火灰，施后培土。在未封垅前，再除草1次。生长2个月后，要“打顶”。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-gb7jn5b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-gb7jn5b","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病虫害防治 锈病：用65％代森锰锌500倍液防治。病毒病：除去中心病株，结合蚜虫防治。虫害有潜叶蝇、红蜘蛛及蚜虫等。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-t18krb8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-t18krb8","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-e84iwof","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-e84iwof","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 （1）赤小豆种子圆柱形而略扁，两端稍平截或圆钝，长5-7mm，直径3-5mm。表面紫红色或暗红棕色。平滑，稍具光泽或无光泽；一侧有线形突起的种脐，偏向一端，白色，约为种子长度的2/3，中央凹陷成纵沟；另侧有一条不明显的种脊。质坚硬，不易破碎；剖开后种皮薄而脆，子叶2枚，乳白色，肥厚，胚根细长，弯向一端。气徽，味微甘，嚼之有豆腥气。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-gzgummh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-gzgummh","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）赤豆种子近矩圆形而稍扁，直径4-6mm，与赤小豆的主要区别为种脐平而不突起，中央也不凹陷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-ui4ddzi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-ui4ddzi","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"均以颗粒饱满、色紫红发暗者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-1l2ofes","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-1l2ofes","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别 （1）赤小豆种子横切面：种皮表皮为1列栅状细胞，壁自内向外逐渐增厚，胞腔含淡红棕色物质，近外侧有1条光辉带。表皮下有1列哑铃状的支柱细胞。薄壁细胞约10余列，位于支柱细胞内方，其内侧数列细胞颓废。位于种脐部位的表皮为2列栅状细胞，外侧有种阜，细胞含众多淀粉粒；内侧有管胞岛，细胞壁网状增厚，其两侧为星状组织，有大型细胞间隙，细胞呈星状。子叶表皮细胞近方形，叶肉细胞含淀粉粒及草酸钙结晶；淀粉众多，近圆形、肾形或圆三角形，直径4-35（-70）μm，脐点星状或裂缝状，层纹明显；草酸钙方晶直径3-13μm，簇晶6-16μm。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-u3razpi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-u3razpi","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）赤豆子叶叶肉细胞不含草酸钙簇晶，草酸钙方晶直径3-6μm。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-hdouakd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-hdouakd","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-qrrcagk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-qrrcagk","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1．赤小豆 含糖类，三萜皂甙（triterpenoidsaponin）。每百克含蛋白质20.7g，脂肪0.5g，碳水化物58g，粗纤维4.9灰分3.3g，钙67mg，磷305mg，铁5.2mg，硫胺素（thiamine）0.3lmg，核黄素（riboflavine）0.11mg，烟酸（nicotinicacid）2.7mg等。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-xwrc6xx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-xwrc6xx","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2．从赤豆中分离得到3-呋喃甲醇-β-D-吡喃葡萄糖甙（3-fu-ranmethanol-β-D-hlucopyranoside），右旋儿茶精-7-O-β-D吡喃葡萄糖甙（catechin-7-O-β-D-glucopyranoside）和1D-5-O-（a-D-吡喃半乳糖基）-4-O-甲基肌醇[1D-5-O（a-D-galactopyranosyl）-4-O-methyl-myoinositol]。还分离得到6个齐墩果烯低聚糖甙（oleanene-oligoglycosides）：赤豆皂甙（azukisaponin）Ⅰ，即是3-O-[β-D-吡喃葡萄糖基（1→2）-β-D-吡喃葡萄糖醛酸基]槐花二醇｛3-O-[β-D-glucopyranosyl（1→2）-β-D-glucuronopyranosyl] sophoradiol｝；赤豆皂甙Ⅱ，即是3-O-[β-D-吡喃葡萄糖基（1→2）-β-D-吡喃葡萄糖醛酸基]大豆皂醇B｛3-O[β-D-glucopyranosyl（1→2）-β-D-glucuronopyranosyl]soyasapogenol B｝；赤豆皂甙Ⅲ，即是3-O-[β-D-吡喃葡萄糖基（1→2）-β-D-吡喃葡萄糖醛酸基]赤豆皂醇｛3-O-[β-D-glucopyranosyl（l→2）-β-D-glucuronopyranosyl]azukisa-pogenol｝；赤豆皂甙Ⅳ，即是3-O[β-D-吡喃葡萄糖基-28-O-吡喃葡萄糖基（l→6）-β-D-吡喃葡萄糖基]刺叶丝石竹酸｛3-O-（β-D-glucopyranosyl）28-D-glucopyranosyl（1→6）-β-D-glucopyranosyl] gypsogenic acid｝；赤豆皂甙Ⅴ，即是3-O-[a-L-吡喃鼠李糖基（l→2）-β-D-吡喃葡萄糖基（1→2）-β-D-吡喃葡萄糖醛酸基]大豆皂醇B｛3-O-[a-L-rhamnopyranosyl（1→2）-β-D-glucopyra-nosyl（l→2）-β-D-glucuronopyranosyl]-soyasapogenol B｝和赤豆皂甙Ⅵ，即是3-O-[β-D吡喃葡萄糖基（1→2）β-D-吡喃葡萄糖醋酸基]-29-O-[β-D-吡喃葡萄糖基（1→6）-β-D-吡喃葡萄糖基]赤豆皂醇｛3-O-[β-D-glucopyranosyl（1→2）β-D-glucuropyranosyl]-29-O-[β-D-glucopyranosyl（1→6）-β-D-glucopyranosyl]azukisapogenol｝。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-9ru9vld","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-9ru9vld","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"从赤豆的热水提取物中还得到三种黄烷醇鞣质（flavanoltannins）：D-儿茶精（D-catechin）、D-儿茶精（D-epicatechin）和表没食子儿茶精（epigallocatechin）。从新鲜种子中分离到原矢车菊素（procyanidin）B1和B3。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-at3kalm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-at3kalm","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-w1pbvs5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-w1pbvs5","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 具抑菌，利尿作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-loraft1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-loraft1","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-i30yzyv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-i30yzyv","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 理化鉴别 本品粗粉1g，加对70％乙醇10ml，沸水浴上加热20min，冷后滤过，取滤液0.2ml，在水浴上蒸干，加醋酐2-3滴、硫酸1-2滴，显黄色，渐变为红色、紫红色。（检查三萜皂甙）"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-28qvqnx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-28qvqnx","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-v4qqlb7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-v4qqlb7","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 心；脾；肾；小肠经"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-mvwqrw0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-mvwqrw0","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-6sy90dx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-6sy90dx","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味甘；酸；性微寒"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-dpm5vaa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-dpm5vaa","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-9rywo3f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-9rywo3f","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 陶弘景：性逐津液，久食令人枯燥。《食性本草》：久食瘦人。《随息居饮食谱》：蛇咬者百日内忌之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-h2a65zw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-h2a65zw","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-ijvrdfm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-ijvrdfm","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 利水消肿退黄；清热解毒消痈。主水肿；脚气；黄疸；淋病；便血；肿毒疮疡；癣疹"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-vthr8b5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-vthr8b5","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-za6u0zz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-za6u0zz","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，10-30g；或入散剂。外用：适量，生研调敷；或煎汤洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-qsxm3nc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-qsxm3nc","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-et93jjd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-et93jjd","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.赤小豆汤(《圣济总录》)，用治脚气气喘，大小便涩，通身肿，两脚气胀，变成水者。2.麻黄连翘赤小豆汤(《伤寒论》)，用治伤寒瘀热在里，身黄者。3.赤小豆散(《圣惠方》)，用治急黄身如金色者。4.赤豆薏苡汤(《疡科捷径》)，用治湿热气滞瘀凝所致大小肠痈。5.消疹汤(《本草纲目》)，用治风瘙瘾疹。6.治消散(《备急千金要方》)，用治痈疽疮毒。7.赤小豆当归散(《金匮要略》)，治大便下血，先血后便。8.赤小豆散(《证治准绳·疡医》)，治胃痛初起，中脘隐痛微肿，寒热如疟，身皮甲错，无咳嗽，咯吐脓血，脉洪数者。9.赤苓散(《千金翼方》)，用治黑疸，皮肤，大便皆黑者。10.铁箍散(《北京中成药规范》)，功效清热解毒，消肿止痛，主治各种痈肿疮疖早期，红肿坚硬瘀痛，及未溃乳疮，焮热瘀痛，若已成脓可使其破溃。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-ww6twre","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-ww6twre","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-ukthvhs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-ukthvhs","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《神农本草经》：主下水，排痈肿脓血。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-m131o84","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-m131o84","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《名医别录》：主寒热，热中，消渴，止泄，利小便，吐逆，卒僻，下胀满。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-dl7098t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-dl7098t","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《药性论》：消热毒痈肿，散恶血不尽、烦满。治水肿皮肌胀满；捣薄涂痈肿上；主小儿急黄、烂疮，取汁令洗之；能令人美食；末与鸡子白调涂热毒痈肿；通气，健脾胃。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-5peg5g0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-5peg5g0","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《食疗本草》：和鲤鱼烂煮食之，甚治脚气及大腹水肿；散气，去关节烦热，令人心孔开，止小便数；绿赤者，并可食。暴利后气满不能食，煮一顿服之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-7tanby3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-7tanby3","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《蜀本草》：病酒热，饮汁。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-qytq7j4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-qytq7j4","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《食性本草》：坚筋骨，疗水气，解小麦热毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-oi9aceg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-oi9aceg","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《日华子本草》：赤豆粉，治烦，解热毒，排脓，补血脉。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-8w40hfh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-8w40hfh","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《本草纲目》：辟温疫，治产难，下胞衣，通乳汁。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-fw9hiuv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-fw9hiuv","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《本草再新》：清热和血，利水通经，宽肠理气。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-ajiw1f3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-ajiw1f3","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.王好古：治水者唯知治水，而不知补胃，则失之壅滞。赤小豆消水通气而健脾胃，乃其药也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-zlhiqct","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-zlhiqct","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11.《本草纲目》：赤小豆，其性下行，通乎小肠，能入阴分，治有形之病。故行津液、利小便，消胀除肿，止吐而治下痢肠僻，解酒病，除寒热痈肿，排脓散血而通乳汁，下胞衣产难，皆病之有形者。久服则降令太过，津液渗泄，所以令肌瘦身重也。其吹鼻瓜蒂散及辟瘟疫用之，亦取其通气除湿散热耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-87stl16","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-87stl16","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12.《本草经疏》：凡水肿、胀满、泄泻，皆湿气伤脾所致，小豆健脾燥湿，故主下水肿胀满，止泄，利小便也。《十剂》云，燥可去湿，赤小豆之属是矣。陶弘景云，小豆逐津液，利小便，久服令人枯燥。凡水肿胀满，总属脾虚，当杂补脾胃药中用之，病己即去，勿过剂也。其治消渴，亦借其能逐胃中热从小便利去，若用之过多，则津液竭而渴愈甚，不可不戒也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-vcxdpma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-vcxdpma","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"13.《本草新编》：赤小豆，可暂用以利水，而不可久用以渗湿。湿症多属气虚，气虚利水，转利转虚而湿愈不能去矣，况赤小豆专利下身之水而不能利上身之湿。盖下身之湿，真湿也，用之而有效；上身之湿，虚湿也，用之而益甚，不可不辨。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-ijoysyg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-ijoysyg","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"14.《本经疏证》：痈肿脓血，是血分病，水肿是气分病，何以赤小豆均能治之？盖气血皆源于脾，以是知血与水同源而异派，浚其源，其流未有不顺者矣。然凡物之于人，能抑其盛者，不必能起其衰，能起其衰者，不必能抑其盛，痈肿脓血为火之有余，水肿则火之不足，赤小豆两者兼治，既损其盛，又补其衰。"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-4blkl51","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-4blkl51","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614101449-m4vpztt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101449-m4vpztt","updated":"20240614101449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614101450-7nipbm8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614101450-7nipbm8"}},{"ID":"20240614101451-f5a9656","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614101451-f5a9656"}}]}